ely insane sideways drift \u2014 passing the Ukrainian UGV by literally a few millimeters", "snippet_en": "A vehicle carrying Ukrainian soldiers is moving at high speed through an anti-drone tunnel somewhere in Donbas, trying to avoid a strike from a Russian FPV drone. At the turn, the driver pulls off an absolutely insane sideways drift \u2014 passing the Ukrainian UGV by literally a few millimeters", "link": "https://t.me/combat_ftg2/3674", "pubDate": "2026-09-07T10:27:07+00:00"}], "updated": "27 Sep 2026, 16:02 UTC", "count": 9}